### 14. VALIDACIÓN: Contraseña sin carácter especial (Criterio 2.2)
### Debe devolver error
### ==============================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "agente123!",
  "new_password": "SoloLetras123",
  "new_password_confirm": "SoloLetras123"
}

### ==============================================
### 15. VALIDACIÓN: Contraseña muy corta (Criterio 2.2)
### Debe devolver error (menos de 8 caracteres)
