### 19. ACTUALIZAR FOTO DE PERFIL
### ==============================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foto_perfil": "https://ejemplo.com/mi-foto.jpg"
}
